 "note": "M, 14 platforms, choke, inward. A river runs down the middle: the only short crossings are two ferries (P-01's prototype relay) - the top one docked at A's pier, the bottom one at B's - each an L gap (12 m, 2.1 s afloat) that carries whatever stands on it. The fixed crossings bend round over the top and bottom axis platforms (two M decks each, slower). Holding a pier means owning its ferry: bring your army over, or steal the enemy's boat. Point-symmetric. Survivor ring: the four piers and the two crossings.",
